                        <provenance>The manuscript can be palaeographically dated to the 18th century. The manuscript came into possession of Governor Ferdinardo Martini between 1897 and 1907 and was later acquired by the Biblioteca Forteguerriana between 1930 and 1931. The book is mentioned in <bibl><ptr target="bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia"></ptr><citedRange>81-84</citedRange></bibl>. It was first catalogued in <bibl><ptr target="bm:Lusini2002Pistoia"/></bibl></provenance>
